      "num_turns": 30,
      "result": "Implemented the persistent Rails URL shortener in `/workspace`. It supports link creation, lookup and listing, redirects with click tracking, and the required validation and error responses.\n\n`start.sh` is executable; it applies pending migrations and starts the server in the foreground on `0.0.0.0:8000`. The README explains how to start it with `DATABASE_URL` configured. I also pinned JSON below version 3 because the installed JSON 3.2.0 caused Rails request parsing to fail.\n\nVerified the API against PostgreSQL: creation, generated and custom codes, duplicate and invalid inputs, malformed JSON, lookups, listing, redirects, click counts, and data persistence across a server restart. The test server has been stopped.",
